    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Ho et al. (2019) & Painter, Ho & Headon (2018) avian feather tracts on a curved trunk-and-limb surface: geodesic EDA competence wave, inhibitory-disk hexagonal packing, density-threshold tract boundaries and curvature-induced 5-7 dislocations — Reproducibility package: 94/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Deterministic (`seed=2018`, bitwise two-run determinism check), 12-check `self_test()` (L1424-1506) covering SHA-256 / provenance, Lean laws 1-6, wave and chi sweeps, EDA density suite ordering, curved-vs-flat defect increase, sphere charge 12, isochrone lemma, specimen segmentation and determinism; full run 48 s and self-test 48 s on the reference environment (< 3 min budget). Outputs: 12-panel comparison PNG, curved-tract PNG and a 3-panel growth GIF." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
